  (77, 8, 6, 'Read it. The steps are good, but split the long step in two and give a visual cue, colour or texture, instead of only a time.', FALSE, '2025-11-01 09:19:00'),
  (78, 8, 5, 'Good point, cues are more reliable than minutes.', FALSE, '2025-11-01 09:31:00'),
  (79, 8, 6, 'Also add the serving size, people always ask.', FALSE, '2025-11-01 09:58:00'),
