  (139, 15, 10, 'Will do. Have a great weekend!', FALSE, '2026-05-13 16:36:00'),
  (140, 16, 12, 'Nothing exotic, but the shop only has a different version of it.', FALSE, '2026-05-14 09:06:00'),
  (141, 16, 7, 'Then use what you have. The recipe is forgiving, just adjust the quantity by taste and add a little at a time.', FALSE, '2026-05-14 09:17:00'),
  (142, 16, 12, 'That is reassuring, I was afraid to ruin it.', FALSE, '2026-05-14 09:32:00'),
  (143, 16, 7, 'You will not. Cooking is mostly tasting and adjusting.', FALSE, '2026-05-14 09:36:00'),
  (144, 16, 12, 'Thanks for the confidence boost, I will let you know how it goes.', FALSE, '2026-05-14 09:51:00'),
  (145, 17, 13, 'Quick question about your Homemade Cheeseburger, if you have a minute.', FALSE, '2026-06-18 13:06:00'),
  (146, 17, 8, 'Sure Thando, go ahead.', FALSE, '2026-06-18 13:34:00'),
  (147, 17, 13, 'Is it okay to prepare part of it the day before? I am cooking for guests on Saturday.', FALSE, '2026-06-18 13:49:00'),
  (148, 17, 8, 'Yes. Do the prep ahead (chopping, sauces, marinades) and keep the final cooking step for the last hour.', FALSE, '2026-06-19 13:49:00'),
  (149, 17, 13, 'Perfect, that takes a lot of stress off. Anything I should avoid doing in advance?', FALSE, '2026-06-19 14:07:00'),
  (150, 17, 8, 'Do not season everything early, salt at the end. And take things out of the fridge a bit before cooking.', FALSE, '2026-06-20 14:46:00'),
