  (207, 23, 13, 'Hi Julie, can I ask a beginner question? I tried Moist Banana Bread and it did not look like the photo.', FALSE, '2026-07-31 09:02:00'),
  (208, 23, 10, 'Of course Thando! What went wrong?', FALSE, '2026-07-31 09:14:00'),
  (209, 23, 13, 'The texture was off and I think I rushed a step.', FALSE, '2026-07-31 09:35:00'),
  (210, 23, 10, 'Rushing or too high heat is the usual culprit for beginners. Lower the heat and give it time.', FALSE, '2026-07-31 09:49:00'),
  (211, 23, 13, 'I will try again slowly. Is it normal to feel nervous in the kitchen?', FALSE, '2026-07-31 10:01:00'),
  (212, 23, 10, 'Totally. Everyone burns something. Read the whole recipe once before starting and prep everything first.', FALSE, '2026-07-31 10:14:00'),
  (213, 23, 13, 'That is a great habit, I always start cooking while still reading.', FALSE, '2026-07-31 10:28:00'),
  (214, 23, 10, 'Try it my way next time and tell me what changed.', FALSE, '2026-07-31 10:53:00'),
